 "notes": "This deck was actually sick and very fun to play. It lost a lot, but all of the games were very close and I think small variance could have had this deck doing very well. \n\nHardened Academic was super fun - strong but not overbearing. Vengevine required some planning but felt strong when it came together. \n\nThere was enough discard / small guys to make it come together. Swinging in with a surprise Vengevine + Academic for 7 hasty damage out of nowhere was pretty common.",
